# .github/CODEOWNERS
#
# Review scope is derived from the ratified text and nothing else.
#   /rip-0001/ is a ratified Process RIP; it is amended through the
#   RIP process it defines.
#   /GOVERNANCE.md is incorporated into RIP-0001 by reference, and
#   §Authority and Amendment binds its amendments to the same
#   process, submission discipline and recording requirements.
#   No other clause imposes review on this repository:
#   §Change Submission Discipline and Emergency Exception binds the
#   official Rincoin Core repository, and SECURITY.md classifies
#   this one as Development.
#
# governance/ is deliberately not gated. GOVERNANCE.md obliges
# core-role.md to be updated whenever an assignment changes, and
# obliges both core-role.md and editor-changes.md to be written as
# Vacancy Determination and Succession run — procedures that operate
# when the Founder is unavailable. A file that must be written in a
# reviewer's absence cannot require that reviewer's approval.
#
# These files record assignments; the provisions of GOVERNANCE.md
# create them. Review of the record is not review of the authority
# the record reports.
#
# Precedence: the LAST matching pattern wins.

